  <h2>Acceptance</h2>
  <p>
    By using decodingvba.com, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not
    use the site.
  </p>

  <h2>Free content</h2>
  <p>
    Lesson tracks and articles on this site are provided for personal and internal business
    learning. You may not republish our content as your own or scrape the site for
    commercial redistribution.
  </p>

  <h2>Paid courses</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Course materials are licensed for your personal or internal business use.</li>
    <li>Redistributing course files, videos, or workbooks is not permitted.</li>
    <li>Refund terms are stated on the checkout page at the time of purchase.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
  <p>
    VBA macros can modify workbooks and data. Test code on copies of production files. We
    are not liable for data loss or business disruption from applying examples on this
    site.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
